# Local-only / non-project files
system-prompt.md

# Docs folder (local notes, not version-controlled).
# Written as docs/* rather than docs/ so the negation below can take effect: git cannot
# re-include a file whose parent DIRECTORY is excluded.
docs/*
# ...except preregistrations. A prereg that is not under version control cannot be "frozen at
# a commit", which is the only property that makes it worth anything.
!docs/V2_PREREGISTRATION.md
!docs/CLOSURE_deca_and_R15.md
# A frozen system specification is a prereg by another name -- SPEC_methane_water.md is
# referenced by Amendment 11 and declares itself frozen at the commit carrying it.
!docs/SPEC_methane_water.md
# SPEC_nacl_water.md is referenced by Amendment 14 and frozen the same way.
!docs/SPEC_nacl_water.md
# SPEC_c60_water.md is referenced by Amendment 16 and frozen the same way.
!docs/SPEC_c60_water.md
# The C60 execution state machine, versioned for the same 15.3 reason as NaCl's.
!docs/C60_EXECUTION_STATE.md
# The execution state machine must be versioned or it cannot pin a commit (Amendment 15.3).
!docs/NACL_EXECUTION_STATE.md
# The uniform-FR campaign preregistration (2026-08-29), frozen for the same reason.
!docs/UNIFORM_FR_CAMPAIGN.md
# Closed-result records that a preregistration's outcome clause points at: the ZIF-8
# corrected-baseline verdict and the LTA read-out sweep. A result a prereg resolves to
# must be pinnable at a commit for the same reason the prereg itself must be.
!docs/ZIF8_CORRECTED_BASELINE.md
!docs/INFORMATION_CLOCK_AUDIT.md
!docs/LTA_READOUT_SWEEP.md
!docs/WCA_BASELINE_AUDIT.md
# WCA phase-diagram transient local run artifacts
results/wca_phase_diagram/*/report_assets/
results/wca_phase_diagram/*/logs/
results/wca_phase_diagram/**/_failures/
results/wca_phase_diagram/*_launch.log
results/wca_phase_diagram/*_detached_*.log
results/wca_phase_diagram/*_tmux_*.sh

# Local scratch (not for VCS)
fable-system-prompt.md

# Oversized raw diagnostic (>100MB GitHub limit; summaries are tracked instead)
results/wca_representative/summaries/adaptive_fr_event_log.csv

# Claude Code session state and worktrees -- not project content
.claude/

# Publisher supporting-information and manuscript files fetched for provenance.
# This repository is PUBLIC: these are copyrighted third-party documents and
# must never be committed. Their URLs, checksums and the parameters extracted
# from them are recorded in cache/*/literature/provenance_*.json instead, which
# is what reproducibility actually needs.
cache/*/literature/*.pdf
cache/*/literature/*.docx
cache/*/literature/*.zip
cache/*/literature/*.html
cache/*/literature/*_extracted.txt
